{"resourceIdentifier":"2370","resourceName":"Zhangye City Afforestation Project in Gansu Province","description":"Zhangye City Afforestation Project in Gansu Province (hereafter “the project”) is located in Zhangye City, Gansu Province of China. Zhangye City is located in the northwest of Gansu Province and in the middle of Hexi corridor where the Qinghai Tibet Plateau and Mongolia Plateau meet. The project’s aim is to increase carbon sequestration and contribute to local sustainable development by planting trees on the barren lands.\r\n23397.80 ha of forest is to be planted by direct planting on barren lands in Zhangye City, and the planted trees are all native species (willow, Elaeagnus angustifolia, Armeniaca sibirica, populus, Ulmus, Picea, Pinus sylvestris, shrub). The implementation of the afforestation project will generate GHG emission removals and mitigate climate change; improve soil and water conservation and forest cover; enhance local biodiversity by increasing the connectivity of forests, and bring income and job opportunities for local communities and residents.\r\nThe project is estimated to generate GHG emission removals of 14,319,589 tCO2e in 60 years, with an average annual GHG emission removal of 238,660 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":39.154800,"longitude":100.508500},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-12-01","endExclusive":"2021-01-01","endInclusive":"2020-12-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2370"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gansu Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhangye Academy of Forestry Sciences"},{"type":"string","value":"Gansu, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"On Hold - see notification letter"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2370"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink",